{"subject":"math3","year":2016,"count":23,"origin":"source","generator":"tools/work/build_analysis_from_blocks.py（source_blocks 原文照录，零编造）","analysis":[{"id":"math3-2016-1","num":1,"desc":"导数图象分析","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2016数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】B.","【解析】对图像进行标记，可知 $x_{1},x_{3},x_{5}$ 为驻点，而在 $x_{1}$ 和 $x_{3}$ 两侧 $f'(x)$ 变号，则为极值点，","$x_{5}$ 两侧 $f'(x)$ 不变号，则不是极值点，在 $x_{2}$ 处一阶导数不存在，但在 $x_{2}$ 两侧 $f'(x)$ 不变号，","则不是极值点，在 $x_{2}$ 处二阶导数不存在，在 $x_{4}$ 和 $x_{5}$ 处二阶导数为零，在这三个点两侧一阶","导函数增减性发生变化，则都为拐点，故应选（B）.","@@M:math3-2016-1:1@@"]}]},{"id":"math3-2016-2","num":2,"desc":"二元函数偏导数","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2016数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】D.","【解析】$f_{x}'=\\dfrac{e^{x}(x-y)-e^{x}}{(x-y)^{2}},f_{y}'=\\dfrac{e^{x}}{(x-y)^{2}}$, 因而 $f_{x}'+f_{y}'=\\dfrac{e^{x}}{x-y}=f$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2016-3","num":3,"desc":"二重积分的对称性","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2016数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】B.","【解析】$D_{1}$ 关于直线 $y=x$ 对称，$J_{1}=\\dfrac{1}{2}\\displaystyle\\iint\\limits_{D_{1}}(\\sqrt[3]{x-y}+\\sqrt[3]{y-x})dxdy=0.$","$D_{1}$ 被直线 $y=x$ 对分成的两个积分区域记为 $D_{11}$ 及 $D_{12}$，则","$\\displaystyle\\iint\\limits_{D_{11}}\\sqrt[3]{x-y}dxdy=-\\displaystyle\\iint\\limits_{D_{12}}\\sqrt[3]{x-y}dxdy$，$\\displaystyle\\iint\\limits_{D_{11}}\\sqrt[3]{x-y}dxdy<0,\\displaystyle\\iint\\limits_{D_{12}}\\sqrt[3]{x-y}dxdy>0$","如图所示,","$J_{2}=\\displaystyle\\iint\\limits_{D_{2}}\\sqrt[3]{x-y}dxdy=\\displaystyle\\iint\\limits_{D_{21}}\\sqrt[3]{x-y}dxdy+\\displaystyle\\iint\\limits_{D_{22}}\\sqrt[3]{x-y}dxdy+\\displaystyle\\iint\\limits_{D_{23}}\\sqrt[3]{x-y}dxdy$,","$J_{3}=\\displaystyle\\iint\\limits_{D_{3}}\\sqrt[3]{x-y}dxdy=\\displaystyle\\iint\\limits_{D_{31}}\\sqrt[3]{x-y}dxdy+\\displaystyle\\iint\\limits_{D_{32}}\\sqrt[3]{x-y}dxdy+\\displaystyle\\iint\\limits_{D_{33}}\\sqrt[3]{x-y}dxdy$,","由轮换对称性可知：$\\displaystyle\\iint\\limits_{D_{31}}\\sqrt[3]{x-y}dxdy=-\\displaystyle\\iint\\limits_{D_{32}}\\sqrt[3]{x-y}dxdy$；","故 $J_{2}=\\displaystyle\\iint\\limits_{D_{2}}\\sqrt[3]{x-y}dxdy=\\displaystyle\\iint\\limits_{D_{23}}\\sqrt[3]{x-y}dxdy>0$，","$J_{3}=\\displaystyle\\iint\\limits_{D_{3}}\\sqrt[3]{x-y}dxdy=\\displaystyle\\iint\\limits_{D_{33}}\\sqrt[3]{x-y}dxdy<0$,","故 $J_{3}<J_{1}<J_{2}$，选（B）.","@@M:math3-2016-3:0@@ @@M:math3-2016-3:1@@ @@M:math3-2016-3:2@@"]}]},{"id":"math3-2016-4","num":4,"desc":"正项级数比较判别法","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2016数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】A.","【解析】$\\Bigl|\\Bigl(\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{n}}-\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{n+1}}\\Bigr)\\sin(n+k)\\Bigr|\\leqslant\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{n}}-\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{n+1}}$","$=\\dfrac{\\sqrt{n+1}-\\sqrt{n}}{\\sqrt{n(n+1)}}=\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{n(n+1)}(\\sqrt{n+1}+\\sqrt{n})}\\leqslant\\dfrac{1}{n^{\\frac{3}{2}}}$ 因而级数绝对收敛，选（A）."]}]},{"id":"math3-2016-5","num":5,"desc":"相似矩阵","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2016数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】C.","【解析】由已知条件，存在可逆矩阵 $P$ 使得 $P^{-1}AP=B.$","那么 $B^{\\mathrm{T}}=(P^{-1}AP)^{\\mathrm{T}}=P^{\\mathrm{T}}A^{\\mathrm{T}}(P^{-1})^{\\mathrm{T}}=P_{1}^{-1}A^{\\mathrm{T}}P_{1}$，其中 $P_{1}=(P^{\\mathrm{T}})^{-1}$，即 $A^{\\mathrm{T}}$ 和 $B^{\\mathrm{T}}$ 相似，（A）正确.","$B^{-1}=(P^{-1}AP)^{-1}=P^{-1}A^{-1}(P^{-1})^{-1}=P^{-1}A^{-1}P$，即 $A^{-1}$ 和 $B^{-1}$ 相似，（B）正确.","又 $P^{-1}(A+A^{-1})P=P^{-1}AP+P^{-1}A^{-1}P=B+B^{-1}$，即 $A+A^{-1}$ 和 $B+B^{-1}$ 相似，（D）正确，","故选 C."]}]},{"id":"math3-2016-6","num":6,"desc":"二次型","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2016数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】C.","【解析】二次型矩阵 $A=\\begin{pmatrix}a&1&1\\\\ 1&a&1\\\\ 1&1&a\\end{pmatrix}$","由特征多项式 $|\\lambda E-A|=\\begin{vmatrix}\\lambda-a&-1&-1\\\\ -1&\\lambda-a&-1\\\\ -1&-1&\\lambda-a\\end{vmatrix}=(\\lambda-a-2)(\\lambda-a+1)^{2}$,","矩阵 $A$ 的特征值，$a+2,a-1,a-1.$ 由 $p=1,q=2$，$\\begin{cases}a+2>0\\\\ a-1<0\\end{cases}\\therefore-2<a<1.$"]}]},{"id":"math3-2016-7","num":7,"desc":"条件概率","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2016数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】A.","【解析】$P(A|B)=1,$ 则 $P(\\overline{A}|B)=0$ 也就有 $P(\\overline{A}B)=0$，","$P(B|\\overline{A})=0$ 得 $P(\\overline{B}|\\overline{A})=1.$"]}]},{"id":"math3-2016-8","num":8,"desc":"独立随机变量","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2016数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】C.","【解析】$D(XY)=E(XY)^{2}-(EXY)^{2}=EX^{2}EY^{2}-(EXEY)^{2}$","$=\\Bigl[DX+(EX)^{2}\\Bigr]\\Bigl[DY+(EY)^{2}\\Bigr]-1^{2}=14.$"]}]},{"id":"math3-2016-9","num":9,"desc":"等价无穷小替换","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2016数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】$6$.","【解析】$\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}\\dfrac{\\sqrt{1+f(x)\\sin2x}-1}{e^{3x}-1}=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}\\dfrac{\\dfrac{1}{2}f(x)\\sin2x}{3x}=\\dfrac{1}{3}\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}f(x)=2$","则 $\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}f(x)=6.$"]}]},{"id":"math3-2016-10","num":10,"desc":"定积分的定义","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2016数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】$\\sin1-\\cos1$","【解析】$\\lim\\limits_{n\\to\\infty}\\dfrac{1}{n^{2}}\\Bigl(\\sin\\dfrac{1}{n}+2\\sin\\dfrac{2}{n}+\\cdots+n\\sin\\dfrac{n}{n}\\Bigr)$","$=\\lim\\limits_{n\\to\\infty}\\dfrac{1}{n}\\Bigl[\\dfrac{1}{n}\\sin\\dfrac{1}{n}+\\dfrac{2}{n}\\sin\\dfrac{2}{n}+\\cdots+\\dfrac{n}{n}\\sin\\dfrac{n}{n}\\Bigr]$","$=\\lim\\limits_{n\\to\\infty}\\dfrac{1}{n}\\displaystyle\\sum_{i=1}^{\\infty}\\dfrac{i}{n}\\sin\\dfrac{i}{n}=\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{1}x\\sin xdx$","$=-x\\cos x\\Big|_{0}^{1}+\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{1}\\cos xdx=\\sin1-\\cos1$"]}]},{"id":"math3-2016-11","num":11,"desc":"隐函数求导","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2016数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】$-dx+2dy.$","【解析】易得 $x=0,y=1$ 时 $z=1$，方程两边求全微分","$zdx+(x+1)dz-2ydy=2xfdx+x^{2}\\bigl[f_{1}'(dx-dz)+f_{2}'dy\\bigr]$","把 $x=0,y=1,z=1$ 代入上式有 $dz\\big|_{(0,1)}=-dx+2dy$"]}]},{"id":"math3-2016-12","num":12,"desc":"二重积分的对称性","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2016数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】$\\dfrac{1}{3}(1-2e^{-1})$.","【解析】利用二重积分的对称性","$\\displaystyle\\iint\\limits_{D}x^{2}e^{-y^{2}}dxdy=2\\displaystyle\\iint\\limits_{D_{\\text{右}}}x^{2}e^{-y^{2}}dxdy=2\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{1}e^{-y^{2}}dy\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{y}x^{2}dx=\\dfrac{2}{3}\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{1}y^{3}e^{-y^{2}}dy$","$=-\\dfrac{1}{3}\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{1}y^{2}de^{-y^{2}}=-\\dfrac{1}{3}\\Bigl(y^{2}e^{-y^{2}}\\Big|_{0}^{1}-2\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{1}ye^{-y^{2}}dy\\Bigr)$","$=-\\dfrac{1}{3}\\Bigl(e^{-1}+e^{-y^{2}}\\Big|_{0}^{1}\\Bigr)=\\dfrac{1}{3}(1-2e^{-1})$"]}]},{"id":"math3-2016-13","num":13,"desc":"行列式按列展开","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2016数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】$\\lambda^{4}+\\lambda^{3}+2\\lambda^{2}+3\\lambda+4.$","【解析】按第 $1$ 列展开","$D=\\lambda\\begin{vmatrix}\\lambda&-1&0\\\\ 0&\\lambda&-1\\\\ 3&2&\\lambda+1\\end{vmatrix}+4(-1)^{4+1}\\begin{vmatrix}-1&0&0\\\\ \\lambda&-1&0\\\\ 0&\\lambda&-1\\end{vmatrix}$","$=\\lambda\\Bigl(\\lambda\\begin{vmatrix}\\lambda&-1\\\\ 2&\\lambda+1\\end{vmatrix}+3\\cdot(-1)^{3+1}\\begin{vmatrix}-1&0\\\\ \\lambda&-1\\end{vmatrix}\\Bigr)+4$","$=\\lambda^{4}+\\lambda^{3}+2\\lambda^{2}+3\\lambda+4$"]}]},{"id":"math3-2016-14","num":14,"desc":"古典概型","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2016数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】$\\dfrac{2}{9}.$","【解析】本题为古典概型，用概率公式 $P(A)=\\dfrac{m}{n}$","$n$ 计算：恰好取 4 次停止，每次取球有 3 种不同颜色，又是有放回的，所以总的情况 $n=3^{4}.$","$m$ 计算：先考虑第 4 次的颜色，这颜色一定与前 3 次的不同. 前 3 次必定已有且仅有 2 种不","同颜色，这样第 4 次抽到第 3 色才凑够 3 种颜色，总之第 4 次有 3 种可能，前 3 次由其余 2 种","颜色构成，其总数为每次有 2 种可能，3 次有 $2^{3}=8$ 种可能，扣除 3 次同一色共 2 种，所以","前 3 次由两种不同颜色构成共有 $8-2=6$ 种可能，所有 $m=3\\cdot6=18.$ 故 $P(A)=\\dfrac{18}{3^{4}}=\\dfrac{2}{9}.$"]}]},{"id":"math3-2016-15","num":15,"desc":"泰勒展开","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2016数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【解】$\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}\\left(\\cos2x+2x\\sin x\\right)^{\\frac{1}{x^{4}}}=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}\\Bigl[1+(\\cos2x-1+2x\\sin x)\\Bigr]^{\\frac{1}{x^{4}}}$","$\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}\\dfrac{\\cos2x-1+2x\\sin x}{x^{4}}=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}\\dfrac{\\Bigl[-\\dfrac{(2x)^{2}}{2!}+\\dfrac{(2x)^{4}}{4!}+o(x^{4})\\Bigr]+2x\\Bigl[x-\\dfrac{x^{3}}{3!}+o(x^{3})\\Bigr]}{x^{4}}$","$=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}\\dfrac{\\dfrac{1}{3}x^{4}+o(x^{4})}{x^{4}}=\\dfrac{1}{3}$","原式 $=e^{\\frac{1}{3}}$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2016-16","num":16,"desc":"需求弹性","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2016数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【解析】（I）由弹性公式 $\\eta=\\Bigl|\\dfrac{p}{Q}\\dfrac{dQ}{dp}\\Bigr|$ 得","$\\dfrac{p}{Q}\\dfrac{dQ}{dp}=\\dfrac{-p}{120-p}$","$-\\dfrac{dQ}{Q}=\\dfrac{dp}{120-p}$","$Q=C(p-120)$","$Q(0)=1200$ 得 $C=-10,$ 需求函数为 $Q(p)=-10(p-120)=10(120-p)$.","（II）收益函数为 $R=Qp=(1200-10p)p$,","边际收益函数为 $\\dfrac{dR}{dQ}=\\dfrac{dR}{dp}\\dfrac{dp}{dQ}=(1200-20p)\\Bigl(-\\dfrac{1}{10}\\Bigr)=2p-120$,","由此可知 $\\dfrac{dR}{dQ}\\Big|_{p=100}=80$，经济意义是销售第 201 件商品时，收益增加 80 万元."]}]},{"id":"math3-2016-17","num":17,"desc":"变限积分求导","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2016数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【解析】","$f(x)=\\begin{cases}\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{x}(x^{2}-t^{2})dt+\\displaystyle\\int_{x}^{1}(t^{2}-x^{2})dt,0<x<1\\\\ \\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{1}(x^{2}-t^{2})dt,x\\geqslant1\\end{cases}=\\begin{cases}\\dfrac{4}{3}x^{3}-x^{2}+\\dfrac{1}{3},0<x<1\\\\ x^{2}-\\dfrac{1}{3},x\\geqslant1\\end{cases}.$","$f'(x)=\\begin{cases}-2x+4x^{2},0<x<1\\\\ 2x,x\\geqslant1\\end{cases}.$","$f(x)$ 在 $x=1$ 处连续，$\\lim\\limits_{x\\to1^{-}}f'(x)=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to1^{-}}(-2x+4x^{2})=2.$","则 $f'_{-}(1)=f'_{+}(1)=2$，故 $f'(1)=2.$","令 $f'(x)=0$，$4x^{2}-2x=0\\ \\ (0<x<1)$","$2x(2x-1)=0$，$x=\\dfrac{1}{2}$","当 $0<x<\\dfrac{1}{2}$，$f'(x)<0$，$f(x)\\searrow$","$\\dfrac{1}{2}<x<1$，$f'(x)>0$，$f(x)\\nearrow$","$x>1$，$f'(x)>0$，$f(x)\\nearrow$","则 $f(x)$ 在 $x=\\dfrac{1}{2}$ 处取最小值，$f\\Bigl(\\dfrac{1}{2}\\Bigr)=\\dfrac{1}{3}-\\Bigl(\\dfrac{1}{2}\\Bigr)^{2}+\\dfrac{4}{3}\\Bigl(\\dfrac{1}{2}\\Bigr)^{3}=\\dfrac{1}{4}.$"]}]},{"id":"math3-2016-18","num":18,"desc":"变限积分换元","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2016数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【解析】","$\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{x}f(x-t)dt\\ \\overset{x-t=u}{=}\\ \\int_{0}^{x}f(u)du$","$\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{x}f(u)du=x\\int_{0}^{x}f(t)dt-\\int_{0}^{x}tf(t)dt+e^{-x}-1$","等式两端对 $x$ 求导得 $f(x)=\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{x}f(t)dt+xf(x)-xf(x)-e^{-x}=\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{x}f(t)dt-e^{-x}$","等式两端再对 $x$ 求导得 $f'(x)=f(x)+e^{-x}$ 即","$f'(x)-f(x)=e^{-x}$,","$f(x)=e^{-\\int -dx}\\Bigl[\\int e^{-x}e^{\\int -dx}+C\\Bigr]=e^{x}\\Bigl(-\\dfrac{1}{2}e^{-2x}+C\\Bigr)$,","又 $f(0)=-1,C=-\\dfrac{1}{2}$,","$f(x)=-\\dfrac{1}{2}e^{x}(e^{-2x}+1)=-\\dfrac{e^{x}+e^{-x}}{2}$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2016-19","num":19,"desc":"幂级数收敛域","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2016数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【解析】","因为 $\\lim\\limits_{n\\to\\infty}\\Bigl|\\dfrac{u_{n+1}}{u_{n}}\\Bigr|=\\lim\\limits_{n\\to\\infty}\\left|\\dfrac{\\dfrac{x^{2(n+1)+2}}{(n+2)(2n+3)}}{\\dfrac{x^{2n+2}}{(n+1)(2n+1)}}\\right|=x^{2}$","所以当 $x^{2}<1$ 时，原级数收敛；当 $x^{2}>1$ 时，原级数发散. 因此原级数的收敛区间为 $(-1,1)$.","而 $x=\\pm1$ 时，原级数变为 $\\displaystyle\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}\\dfrac{1}{(n+1)(2n+1)}$ 是收敛的，原级数的收敛域为 $[-1,1]$.","设 $S(x)=\\displaystyle\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}\\dfrac{x^{2n+2}}{(n+1)(2n+1)},x\\in(-1,1)$，则 $\\forall x\\in(-1,1)$ 有","$S'(x)=2\\displaystyle\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}\\dfrac{x^{2n+1}}{2n+1},S''(x)=2\\displaystyle\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}x^{2n}=\\dfrac{2}{1-x^{2}}$,","所以 $S'(x)=S'(0)+\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{x}S''(t)dt=\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{x}\\dfrac{2}{1-t^{2}}dt=\\ln\\dfrac{1+x}{1-x}$.","$S(x)=S(0)+\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{x}S'(t)dt=\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{x}\\ln\\dfrac{1+t}{1-t}dt$","$=t\\ln\\dfrac{1+t}{1-t}\\Big|_{0}^{x}-\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{x}td\\ln\\dfrac{1+t}{1-t}=x\\ln\\dfrac{1+x}{1-x}-\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{x}\\dfrac{2t}{1-t^{2}}dt=x\\ln\\dfrac{1+x}{1-x}+\\ln(1-x^{2})$","$x=\\pm1$ 时，$\\displaystyle\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}\\dfrac{1}{(n+1)(2n+1)}=2\\displaystyle\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}\\dfrac{1}{(2n+2)(2n+1)}=2\\displaystyle\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}\\Bigl(\\dfrac{1}{2n+1}-\\dfrac{1}{2n+2}\\Bigr)$","$=2\\bigl(1-\\dfrac{1}{2}+\\dfrac{1}{3}-\\dfrac{1}{4}+...\\bigr)=2\\ln2$.","故 $S(x)=\\begin{cases}x\\ln\\dfrac{1+x}{1-x}+\\ln(1-x^{2}),-1<x<1\\\\ 2\\ln2,x=\\pm1\\end{cases}.$"]}]},{"id":"math3-2016-20","num":20,"desc":"非齐次线性方程组","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2016数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【解析】对 $(A|\\boldsymbol{\\beta})$ 作初等行变换，有","$(A|\\boldsymbol{\\beta})=\\begin{pmatrix}1&1&1-a&0\\\\ 1&0&a&1\\\\ a+1&1&a+1&2a-2\\end{pmatrix}\\to\\begin{pmatrix}1&1&1-a&0\\\\ 0&-1&2a-1&1\\\\ 0&-a&a(a+1)&2a-2\\end{pmatrix}$","$\\to\\begin{pmatrix}1&1&1-a&0\\\\ 0&-1&2a-1&1\\\\ 0&0&a(2-a)&a-2\\end{pmatrix}$","因方程组无解，故 $a=0.$","（II）对 $A^{\\mathrm{T}}A\\boldsymbol{x}=A^{\\mathrm{T}}\\boldsymbol{\\beta}$，又 $A^{\\mathrm{T}}A=\\begin{pmatrix}1&1&1\\\\ 1&0&1\\\\ 1&0&1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}1&1&1\\\\ 1&0&0\\\\ 1&1&1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}3&2&2\\\\ 2&2&2\\\\ 2&2&2\\end{pmatrix}$,","$A^{\\mathrm{T}}\\boldsymbol{\\beta}=\\begin{pmatrix}1&1&1\\\\ 1&0&1\\\\ 1&0&1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}0\\\\ 1\\\\ -2\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}-1\\\\ -2\\\\ -2\\end{pmatrix}$，对 $\\bigl(A^{\\mathrm{T}}A\\big|A^{\\mathrm{T}}\\boldsymbol{\\beta}\\bigr)$ 作初等行变换有","$\\begin{pmatrix}3&2&2&-1\\\\ 2&2&2&-2\\\\ 2&2&2&-2\\end{pmatrix}\\to\\begin{pmatrix}1&0&0&1\\\\ 0&1&1&-2\\\\ 0&0&0&0\\end{pmatrix}$，得方程组 $A^{\\mathrm{T}}A\\boldsymbol{x}=A^{\\mathrm{T}}\\boldsymbol{\\beta}$ 的通解为","$(1,-2,0)^{\\mathrm{T}}+k(0,-1,1)^{\\mathrm{T}}$，$k$ 为任意常数."]}]},{"id":"math3-2016-21","num":21,"desc":"相似对角化","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2016数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【解析】（I）由 $A$ 的特征多项式","$|\\lambda E-A|=\\begin{vmatrix}\\lambda&1&-1\\\\ -2&\\lambda+3&0\\\\ 0&0&\\lambda\\end{vmatrix}=\\lambda(\\lambda+1)(\\lambda+2)$，即 $A$ 的特征值为 $0,-1,-2.$","对 $\\lambda=0$ 由 $(0E-A)\\boldsymbol{x}=\\boldsymbol{0}$，","$\\begin{pmatrix}0&1&-1\\\\ -2&3&0\\\\ 0&0&0\\end{pmatrix}$","得基础解系 $\\boldsymbol{\\gamma}_{1}=(3,2,2)^{\\mathrm{T}}$","对 $\\lambda=-1$ 由 $(-E-A)\\boldsymbol{x}=\\boldsymbol{0}$，","$\\begin{pmatrix}1&-1&0\\\\ 0&0&1\\\\ 0&0&0\\end{pmatrix}$","得基础解系 $\\boldsymbol{\\gamma}_{2}=(1,1,0)^{\\mathrm{T}}$","对 $\\lambda=-2$ 由 $(-2E-A)\\boldsymbol{x}=\\boldsymbol{0}$，","$\\begin{pmatrix}-2&1&0\\\\ 0&0&1\\\\ 0&0&0\\end{pmatrix}$","得基础解系 $\\boldsymbol{\\gamma}_{3}=(1,2,0)^{\\mathrm{T}}$","令 $P=(\\boldsymbol{\\gamma}_{1},\\boldsymbol{\\gamma}_{2},\\boldsymbol{\\gamma}_{3})$ 有 $P^{-1}AP=\\Lambda=\\begin{pmatrix}0&&\\\\ &-1&\\\\ &&-2\\end{pmatrix}$，对于 $P$，利用初等变换可求出","$P^{-1}=\\dfrac{1}{2}\\begin{pmatrix}0&0&1\\\\ 4&-2&-4\\\\ -2&2&1\\end{pmatrix}$,","则 $P^{-1}A^{99}P=\\Lambda^{99}\\Rightarrow A^{99}=P\\Lambda^{99}P^{-1}=\\begin{pmatrix}3&1&1\\\\ 2&1&2\\\\ 2&0&0\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}0&&\\\\ &-1&\\\\ &&-2^{99}\\end{pmatrix}\\dfrac{1}{2}\\begin{pmatrix}0&0&1\\\\ 4&-2&-4\\\\ -2&2&1\\end{pmatrix}$","$=\\begin{pmatrix}-2+2^{99}&1-2^{99}&2-2^{98}\\\\ -2+2^{100}&1-2^{100}&2-2^{99}\\\\ 0&0&0\\end{pmatrix}.$","（II）因 $B^{2}=BA$ 知 $B^{3}=B(BA)=B^{2}A=BA^{2}$,","归纳得","$B^{100}=BA^{99}=(\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{1},\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{2},\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{3})\\begin{pmatrix}-2+2^{99}&1-2^{99}&2-2^{98}\\\\ -2+2^{100}&1-2^{100}&2-2^{99}\\\\ 0&0&0\\end{pmatrix}$,","$=\\bigl((-2+2^{99})\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{1}+(-2+2^{100})\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{2},(1-2^{99})\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{1}+(1-2^{100})\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{2},(2-2^{98})\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{1}+(2-2^{99})\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{2}\\bigr)$","$\\boldsymbol{\\beta}_{1}=(-2+2^{99})\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{1}+(-2+2^{100})\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{2};\\ \\boldsymbol{\\beta}_{2}=(1-2^{99})\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{1}+(1-2^{100})\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{2};$","$\\boldsymbol{\\beta}_{3}=(2-2^{98})\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{1}+(2-2^{99})\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{2}.$"]}]},{"id":"math3-2016-22","num":22,"desc":"二维均匀分布","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2016数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【解析】（I）$(X,Y)$ 的概率密度可用在区域 $D$ 上均匀分布的密度公式直接写出：","$S_{D}=\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{1}(\\sqrt{x}-x^{2})dx=\\dfrac{1}{3}$","$f_{1}(x,y)=\\begin{cases}3,0<x<1,x^{2}<y<\\sqrt{x}\\\\ 0,\\text{其他}\\end{cases}$","（II）由于 $U$ 是离散型随机变量，考查 $U$ 与 $X$ 是否独立，只要验证是否成立，","$P\\{U=i,X\\leqslant x_{1}\\}=P\\{U=i\\}P\\{X\\leqslant x_{1}\\},i=0,1.$","不妨取 $0\\leqslant x_{1}\\leqslant1$，则有","$P\\{U=0,X\\leqslant x_{1}\\}=P\\{X>Y,X\\leqslant x_{1}\\}=P\\{Y<X\\leqslant x_{1}\\}=\\displaystyle\\iint\\limits_{y<x\\leqslant x_{1}}f_{1}(x,y)dxdy$","$=\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{x_{1}}dx\\displaystyle\\int_{x^{2}}^{x}3dy=\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{x_{1}}3(x-x^{2})dx=\\dfrac{3}{2}x_{1}^{2}-x_{1}^{3}$,","$P\\{U=0\\}=P\\{X>Y\\}=\\displaystyle\\iint\\limits_{x>y}f_{1}(x,y)dxdy=\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{1}dx\\displaystyle\\int_{x^{2}}^{x}3dy=\\dfrac{1}{2}$,","$P\\{X\\leqslant x_{1}\\}=\\displaystyle\\iint\\limits_{x\\leqslant x_{1}}f_{1}(x,y)dxdy=\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{x_{1}}dx\\displaystyle\\int_{x^{2}}^{\\sqrt{x}}3dy=2x_{1}^{\\frac{3}{2}}-x_{1}^{3}$,","所以 $P\\{U=i,X\\leqslant x_{1}\\}\\neq P\\{U=i\\}P\\{X\\leqslant x_{1}\\},i=0,1.$ 即 $U$ 与 $X$ 不相互独立.","（III）$Z=U+X$ 其分布函数","$F(z)=P\\{Z\\leqslant z\\}=P\\{U+X\\leqslant z\\}$","$=P\\{U=0,U+X\\leqslant z\\}+P\\{U=1,U+X\\leqslant z\\}$","$=P\\{X>Y,X\\leqslant z\\}+P\\{X\\leqslant Y,X\\leqslant z-1\\}$","$=\\displaystyle\\iint\\limits_{x>y,x\\leqslant z}f_{1}(x,y)dxdy+\\displaystyle\\iint\\limits_{x\\leqslant y,x\\leqslant z-1}f_{1}(x,y)dxdy$","当 $z<0$ 时，$F(z)=0$;","当 $0\\leqslant z<1$ 时，$F(z)=\\displaystyle\\iint\\limits_{x>y\\atop x\\leqslant z}f_{1}(x,y)dxdy+0=\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{z}dx\\displaystyle\\int_{x^{2}}^{x}3dy=\\dfrac{3}{2}z^{2}-z^{3}$;","当 $1\\leqslant z<2$ 时，","$F(z)=\\displaystyle\\iint\\limits_{x>y\\atop x\\leqslant z}f_{1}(x,y)dxdy+\\displaystyle\\iint\\limits_{x\\leqslant y\\atop x\\leqslant z-1}f_{1}(x,y)dxdy=\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{1}dx\\displaystyle\\int_{x^{2}}^{x}3dy+\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{z-1}dx\\displaystyle\\int_{x}^{\\sqrt{x}}3dy$","$=\\dfrac{1}{2}+2(z-1)^{\\frac{3}{2}}-\\dfrac{3}{2}(z-1)^{2}$;","当 $z\\geqslant2$ 时，$F(z)=1$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2016-23","num":23,"desc":"最大顺序统计量","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2016数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【解析】（I）$F(x)=\\displaystyle\\int_{-\\infty}^{x}f(x;\\theta)dx=\\begin{cases}0,&x<0\\\\ \\dfrac{x^{3}}{\\theta^{3}},&0\\leqslant x<\\theta\\\\ 1,&\\theta\\leqslant x\\end{cases}$","$F_{T}(t)=P\\{T\\leqslant t\\}=P\\{\\max(X_{1},X_{2},X_{3})\\leqslant t\\}=P\\{X_{1}\\leqslant t,X_{2}\\leqslant t,X_{3}\\leqslant t\\}$","由于 $X_{1},X_{2},X_{3}$ 相互独立，所以 $P\\{X_{1}\\leqslant t\\}P\\{X_{2}\\leqslant t\\}P\\{X_{3}\\leqslant t\\}=F^{3}(t)$","$f_{T}(t)=F_{T}'(t)=3F_{T}^{2}(t)f(t;\\theta)=\\begin{cases}3\\bigl(\\dfrac{t^{3}}{\\theta^{3}}\\bigr)^{2}\\dfrac{3t^{2}}{\\theta^{3}},0<t<\\theta\\\\ 0,\\text{其他}\\end{cases}=\\begin{cases}\\dfrac{9t^{8}}{\\theta^{9}},0<t<\\theta\\\\ 0,\\text{其他}\\end{cases}$","（II）$ET=\\displaystyle\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty}tf_{T}(t)dt=\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{\\theta}\\dfrac{9t^{9}}{\\theta^{9}}dt=\\dfrac{9}{10}\\theta,E(aT)=aET=a\\cdot\\dfrac{9}{10}\\theta=\\theta$，则 $a=\\dfrac{10}{9}.$"]}]}]}